 "applies_to": "DCRL3, DCRL5 and DCRL8 automatic power factor controllers with optical port or EXP10xx modules (Modbus TCP on DCRL8 only), per protocol document I427 GB 05 20.",
 "summary": "The DCRL3, DCRL5 and DCRL8 are Lovato automatic power factor controllers (the register table covers up to 14 steps). They speak Modbus RTU and ASCII, and the DCRL8 also Modbus TCP, on the optical port or EXP10xx expansion modules. This map covers voltage, current, power factor, powers, alarm bits, step timers and counters, harmonics and the mode, step and reset commands.",
